. Tell PiP to watch a GitHub repository (\"when CI fails on main, fix it and tell me\"), or watch a pull request from a session until it merges; webhooks bring other services' posts to Pi. Only the…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3b96f0b67159e4cc0ef97cea314c66bc2be19aea64bbf10dc5db8740a18236ed","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:35.779Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.628Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A durable, multiplayer, mobile-first web app for Pi agents, built on Pi Durable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in to a provider with Pi first (pi, then /login), or later from the app's Providers sheet.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The launcher asks how your devices should connect, then prints the address, a sign-in link, and a QR code.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3b96f0b67159e4cc0ef97cea314c66bc2be19aea64bbf10dc5db8740a18236ed","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.629Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T04:03:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TannerMidd/pi-pocket/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.632Z","hash":"3b96f0b67159e4cc0ef97cea314c66bc2be19aea64bbf10dc5db8740a18236ed","originalBytes":17379,"storedBytes":17379,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.542Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://tannermidd.github.io/pi-pocket/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-15T22:01:12.875Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T22:01:12.875Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-15T22:01:12.875Z","target":"https://tannermidd.github.io/pi-pocket/","failureCount